    "apiMarkdown": "`useDarkMode(options?): { mode, isDark, setMode, toggle, enable, disable }` — `mode` is `\"system\" | \"light\" | \"dark\"`. Options: `defaultMode` (`\"system\"`), `storageKey` (`\"usefy-dark-mode\"`), `element` (`<html>`), `attribute` (write an attribute instead of a class), `darkClass` (`\"dark\"`).",
